@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor "Customer" as C
actor "Executive" as E
actor "Admin" as A
participant "WhatsApp" as WA
participant "Backend\nService" as B
database "Database" as DB
participant "Delivery\nGroup" as DG
actor "Delivery\nPerson" as DP

== Customer Registration & Shopping ==
C -> WA: Send "Hi"
WA -> B: Webhook: Text Message
B -> B: UserRoleLookupService\nNo match -> Create Customer
B -> C: "What's your name?"
C -> WA: Send Name
B -> C: "Share your phone number"
C -> WA: Send Phone
B -> C: "Share your location"
C -> WA: Send Location
B -> B: Validate delivery area
B -> DB: Save customer
B -> C: "You're registered! Send 'start'"

== Product Selection ==
C -> WA: Send "start"
B -> DB: Fetch available products
B -> C: Product list (interactive)
C -> WA: Select fish product
B -> C: "How many KG?"
C -> WA: Enter quantity (e.g., 2)
B -> DB: Add to cart
B -> C: "Added to cart!" + buttons

== Checkout Process ==
C -> WA: Click "Checkout"
B -> DB: Get cart items
B -> C: Cart summary + "Confirm Order" button
C -> WA: Click "Confirm Order"

== Order Placement ==
B -> DB: Create order (status: PENDING)
B -> DB: Create order items
B -> DB: Clear cart
B -> C: ✅ Order Confirmed! #123
B -> DG: 🔔 NEW ORDER #123 + "Confirm Delivery" button

== Delivery Assignment ==
DP -> WA: Click "Confirm Delivery"
WA -> B: Webhook: Button Reply
B -> DB: Check if DP has DELIVERY_PERSON role

alt Authorized Delivery Person
    B -> DB: Update order (status: CONFIRMED)
    B -> C: 🚚 Delivery Person Assigned!
    B -> DG: ✅ ORDER CONFIRMED (with DP details)
else Unauthorized User
    B -> DP: ❌ Unauthorized Access
end

== Executive Flow (Add Customer) ==
E -> WA: Send "Hi"
WA -> B: Webhook
B -> B: UserRoleLookupService\nFound: EXECUTIVE role
B -> E: Executive Menu
E -> WA: Select "Add Customer"
B -> E: "Enter customer name"
E -> WA: Send name
B -> E: "Enter phone number"
E -> WA: Send phone
B -> E: "Share location"
E -> WA: Send location
B -> DB: Save customer
B -> E: ✅ Customer added!

== Admin Flow (Manage Entities) ==
A -> WA: Send "Hi"
WA -> B: Webhook
B -> B: UserRoleLookupService\nFound: ADMIN role
B -> A: Admin Menu\n• Customers\n• Delivery\n• Executives\n• Assistants\n• Contact Dev
A -> WA: Select "Customers"
B -> A: Customer Menu\n• Add\n• Show All\n• Back
A -> WA: Select "Add"
B -> A: "Enter customer name"
A -> WA: Send details...
B -> DB: Save customer
B -> A: ✅ Customer added!

@enduml
